00:37:17,701 --> 00:37:20,700
The main purpose of EDL is to take a spacecraft that

657
00:37:20,701 --> 00:37:25,200
that is traveling at 12,500 miles an hour relative to the surface,

658
00:37:25,201 --> 00:37:29,340
and bring it to a screeching halt in a soft way

