00:37:31,841 --> 00:37:36,320
Failure now would lay waste to a $457 million project

661
00:37:36,321 --> 00:37:39,820
to study the history of water on Mars.

662
00:37:39,821 --> 00:37:42,460
We have to make sure that when we hit the atmosphere,

663
00:37:42,461 --> 00:37:44,380
we're hitting it at the right speed,

664
00:37:44,381 --> 00:37:46,400
and we're hitting it at the right angle.

