00:37:46,401 --> 00:37:49,320
If you come in too steep, you can burn up.

666
00:37:49,321 --> 00:37:52,560
in too shallow, you can actually kind of go dip

667
00:37:52,660 --> 00:37:54,520
into the atmosphere and then skip out,

668
00:37:54,620 --> 00:37:57,460
and then not land on the planet at all.

669
00:37:57,560 --> 00:38:01,160
Phoenix now one minute past the entry point.

